# Datasets and model weights are NEVER committed. SCUT-FBP5500 is non-commercial research
# only and redistribution is prohibited - see docs/LICENSING.md. The repo ships download
# scripts, never data.
# NOTE: these are anchored with a leading slash so they match only the top-level
# directories, not source packages such as src/facet/data/.
/data/
/artifacts/
/.cache/

*.onnx
*.pth
*.pt
*.caffemodel
*.xlsx
*.zip

# Experiment outputs: results.json, manifest.json and FINDINGS.md ARE committed - they are
# the experimental record. Large per-run binaries are not.
experiments/**/checkpoints/
experiments/**/*.npy

__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
.ipynb_checkpoints/
.venv/
*.egg-info/
.pytest_cache/
.DS_Store

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# The index and the feature store. Both were committed by mistake, and both are
# exactly what docs/LICENSING.md section 4 says must never leave the machine:
#
#   facet.db   image paths, bounding boxes, keypoints, feedback - AND the users
#              table (password hashes, salts) and live session tokens.
#   feats/*.bin  face embeddings, which are re-identifiable without the source
#              images. This is biometric data (GDPR Art. 9).
#
# Untracking them stops the bleeding; it does not remove them from history.
# See README "If you cloned this before <date>".
/facet.db
/facet.db-*
/facet.db.*.bak
/feats/
*.bak
